{"strongs": "H7648", "word": "שׂ֫בַע", "translit": "so.va", "root": "שבך", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "satiety, abundance", "definition": "שׂ֫בַע noun [masculine] satiety, abundance ; — absolute ׳ לָשׂ Exod 16:3 +, cstr שׂבַע Ps 16:11 , ׳ לְשׂ Prov 13:25 suffix שָׂבֶעֶ֑ךָ Deut 23:25 , שָׂבְעָהּ Ruth 2:18 — 1. satiety as to food Ruth 2:18 ׳ לָשׂ (לֶחֶםׅ אָכַל Exod 16:3 ( P ), Lev 25:19 ; Lev 26:5 (both H ), compare ׳ לָשׂ Ps 78:25 ׳ אָכַלכְּ֗֗֗נַפְשְׁךָ שׂ Deut 23:25 eat grapes according to thine appeitite , (namely) thy fill , compare נַפְשׁוֺ ׳ אָכַל לְשׂ Prov 13:25 . 2. satisfying abundance , שְׂמָחוֺת ׳ שׂ Ps 16:11 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8153')\">BDB8153</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7648')\">H7648</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8152')\">BDB8152</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8154')\">BDB8154</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שׂ֫בַע</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>satiety, abundance</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לָשׂ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 16:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,3)\">Exod 16:3</ref> +, cstr <bdbheb>שׂבַע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 16:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,16,11)\">Ps 16:11</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְשׂ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 13:25\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,25)\">Prov 13:25</ref> suffix <bdbheb>שָׂבֶעֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 23:25\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,25)\">Deut 23:25</ref>, <bdbheb>שָׂבְעָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ruth 2:18\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(8,2,18)\">Ruth 2:18</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b><highlight>satiety</highlight> as to food <ref ref=\"Ruth 2:18\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18